      "text": "Steps For Make NoteApp\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Steps For Make NoteApp\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nawQ_oZOCBOr2nGADAFV-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 257.33331298828125,
      "y": 121.66668192545575,
      "width": 986.4793701171875,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 887478928,
      "version": 2001,
      "versionNonce": 1012906367,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "5r2zyMqlicNJcnQEdSPD5",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1787723816108,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. make server.js file and do setup.\n\n2. now make src folder and create app.js file.\n\n3. now create server using express and export then import in server.js file.\n\n4. now setup of database for make connection between server and database.\n    i. for setup database require mongoose so install it.\n    ii. create config folder make db.js file inside the folder.\n    iii. use mongoose in db.js file.\n    iv. create async function which name is connectDB.\n    v. use mongoose.connect(\"URL\") for connection in side try catch block.\n    vi. then export connectDB fumction and import in app.js and call.\n\n5. after connect databse first work is make schemas and for that make models\n    folder and make modelName.model.js file.\n    i. in model file first require mongoose.\n    ii. make varibale (noteSchema) which is store schemas and make schemas usnig mongoose.schema()\n        method.\n    iii. in this method use object and in that object create schema. new mongoose.schema({ schema })\n        Use new keyword because mongoose.schema() is a class.\n    iv. after creating schemas now make model(NoteModel) that schemas using mongoose.model()\n        method. mongoose.model(\"note\", noteSchema)\n    v. then export model and import in required files. Mainly use in controller file for CRUD.\n        ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. make server.js file and do setup.\n\n2. now make src folder and create app.js file.\n\n3. now create server using express and export then import in server.js file.\n\n4. now setup of database for make connection between server and database.\n    i. for setup database require mongoose so install it.\n    ii. create config folder make db.js file inside the folder.\n    iii. use mongoose in db.js file.\n    iv. create async function which name is connectDB.\n    v. use mongoose.connect(\"URL\") for connection in side try catch block.\n    vi. then export connectDB fumction and import in app.js and call.\n\n5. after connect databse first work is make schemas and for that make models\n    folder and make modelName.model.js file.\n    i. in model file first require mongoose.\n    ii. make varibale (noteSchema) which is store schemas and make schemas usnig mongoose.schema()\n        method.\n    iii. in this method use object and in that object create schema. new mongoose.schema({ schema })\n        Use new keyword because mongoose.schema() is a class.\n    iv. after creating schemas now make model(NoteModel) that schemas using mongoose.model()\n        method. mongoose.model(\"note\", noteSchema)\n    v. then export model and import in required files. Mainly use in controller file for CRUD.\n        ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
